      "id": "claim_0f9b8eef3d60480298e750e330246872",
      "statement": "The extraction-agent is a single ASGI app that serves both a REST intake API (/v1: project registration, ingestions/check, ingestions, ingestion lookup) and the A2A skill endpoint (serve mounted at /), and per its OpenAPI contract it owns the Project, Artifact, ArtifactVersion and Element nodes in the knowledge graph.",
