      "id": "claim_9c1574c807e5423fb5c230f9a1c60e0b",
      "statement": "The Manifest model (extra forbidden) carries mode full/partial, optional sourceRevision, kindRules mapping globs to kinds (requirements, architecture-doc, architecture-model, code, test, other) with optional format, and up to MAX_FILES = 20000 files each with a strict 64-hex sha256 and unique safe paths; kind_of resolves a path via the first matching rule using PurePosixPath.full_match, defaulting to other/None.",
