    {
      "id": "claim_ae00bfa613024fb0bd24242c2738a07a",
      "statement": "The versioning transaction runs after blob storage in one kg.write_tx: it increments Project.ingestionSeq (404 if project missing), creates a deterministic Ingestion id via stable_id(ing, project, seq), MERGEs Artifact and ArtifactVersion (version id keyed by stable_id(ver, artifact, sha256), so identical content is a no-op counted in unchangedCount), ACTIVATED edge, clears deletedAt, and deletes/recreates CURRENT_VERSION so revert-and-readd reactivates existing versions; in full mode only, artifacts absent from the manifest get CURRENT_VERSION removed, deletedAt set, and a DELETED edge.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://services/extraction-agent/src/sandman_extraction/ingest.py#L132-L217",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e98dfa40e704280319a26b455e5249f6b841b27b5b27ab7844385ff1552052ee:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_a49f7db0f9844c878a81f539bbcd2102",
      "statement": "sandman.ingestion.completed is published only when something changed: the Ingestion is created with eventPublished = not(items or deleted), the event id is uuid5(NAMESPACE_URL, ingestion id) so JetStream dedupes replays, eventPublished is set true only after the publish ack, and a PublishError yields 503 with the pending event re-published at startup and before every intake (at-least-once outbox invariant).",
