    {
      "id": "claim_c8b3b3caf6284e02baa8572a8ed07477",
      "statement": "All KG writes in the skill happen in one transaction per artifact version: _write_elements replaces the version's complete element set (MERGE by localKey stable id, delete stale HAS_ELEMENT edges, parent CONTAINS) and _write_links deactivates the version's previous explicit-reference TraceLinks before re-activating found ones; links/relations are written after all element sets so cross-version references resolve, and every Element/TraceLink gets Run PRODUCED provenance with cleanup_stale keyed on sha256(canonical_json({input, tool, configHash})) making re-extraction idempotent.",
